# Intent-gate run artifacts (transcripts, artifacts, reports) — transient, and
# they carry full model output; the sibling `runs/` and `runs-planning/` are
# ignored at the repository root for the same reason.
runs-intent/
# `stageCoredocPlugin` in harness/run-planning.ts rm's and
# re-copies this from `skills/coredoc-mcp/` on every run, so it is build output.
# It was tracked, which meant a stale 24 KB copy of a 6 KB skill sat in the repo
# reading as authoritative, and every planning run left the tree dirty. The
# plugin-skills CI drift gate covers `plugins/coredoc/skills`, not this path.
_skill-plugin/
